kill/uo_jobs_anil/\"><img alt=\"동물지식\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_al.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_vet/\"><img alt=\"수의학\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_v.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_carto/\"><img alt=\"보물사냥꾼\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_car.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_lock/\"><img alt=\"자물쇠열기\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_lock.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_fishing/\"><img alt=\"낚시\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_f.gif\" width=\"110\"></a><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_ss/\"><img alt=\"심령술[죽은자와대화]\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_sp.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_camping/\"><img alt=\"야영\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_cam.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_lumber/\"><img alt=\"나무패기\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_lum.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_detect/\"><img alt=\"숨은물체찿기\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_d.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_tracking/\"><img alt=\"추적\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_tra.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_armslore/\"><img alt=\"장비지식\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_arm.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_item/\"><img alt=\"아이템감정\" border=\"0\" height=\"20\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_id.gif\" width=\"110\"></a></font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><img border=\"0\" height=\"5\" src=\"/img/posts/site/skill/images/left_menu/j_line.gif\" width=\"110\"></font></p></td>\n<td height=\"10\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"20\" width=\"627\"><p align=\"left\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;&nbsp;</b></font><a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_carto/\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">기초지식</font></a>/<a href=\"/site/skill/uo_jobs_carto_1/\"><font color=\"black\">스킬도표</font></a>/<a href=\"/site/skill/images/tmap/\"><font color=\"black\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><font color=\"black\">보물지도</font></font></font></a><font color=\"black\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><font color=\"black\"><font color=\"black\">/<font color=\"black\"><a href=\"/site/skill/images/imap/\"><font color=\"black\"><font color=\"black\"><font color=\"black\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><font color=\"black\">섬맵지도</font></font></font></font></a></font></font></font></font></font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"39\" width=\"630\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;</font></p>\n<table align=\"center\" border=\"1\" bordercolor=\"#CCCCCC\" cellpadding=\"0\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\" width=\"500\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F4\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"492\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;몬스터별 \n                            지도를 획득 할 수 있는 레벨분류</b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>1렙지도</b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Ore Elementals, Earth Elementals, Ettins, Fire Gargoyles, Gargoyles, Gazers, \nliches*, Ogres, Ophidian Enforcers, Ophidian Warriors, Orcs, Orcish Lords, Orc \nMages, Sea Serpents (낚시로 건져올린), Terathan Warriors, Trolls.(리치는 보통3렙을 \n                            주지만 흔하지 않게 1렙도 줍니다)</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>2렙지도</b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Air Elementals, Drakes, Fire Elementals, Frost Trolls, </font>\n</p><p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Ophidian Apprentice \nMages, Ophidian Shaman, Reapers, </font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Sea Serpents (일반적으로 \n                            리스펀된), Snow \nElementals, Stone Gargoyles, Water Elementals, Wyverns</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>3렙지도</b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Arctic Ogre Lords, Cyclopean Warriors, Cyclops, Dread Spiders, </font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Efreets, \nLiches*, Ogre Lords, Ophidian Avengers, </font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Ophidian Knight-Errants, </font></p>\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Snow \nElementals, Terathan Avengers.</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>4렙지도</b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Daemons, Dragons, Ice Fiends, Krakens, Lich Lords, Ophidian Matriarchs, Terathan \nMatriarchs, White Wyrms.</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>5렙지도</b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">Ancient Liches, Ancient Wyrms, Balrons, Blood Elementals, Poison Elementals, \nShadow Wyrms, Titans.</font></p></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td bgcolor=\"#F0F0F4\" colspan=\"2\" height=\"30\" width=\"492\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>&nbsp;이름으로 \n                            알 수 있는 지도별 레벨분류</b></font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>1렙지도</b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">&nbsp;간결하게 \n                            그려진 낡은 보물지도</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>2렙지도</b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">잘그려진 \n                            낡은 보물지도</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>3렙지도</b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">숙달된솜씨로 \n                            그려진 낡은 보물지도</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>4렙지도</b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">교묘하게 \n                            그려진 낡은 보물지도</font></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"76\">\n<p align=\"center\" style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font color=\"#666666\" face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\"><b>5렙지도</b></font></p>\n</td>\n<td height=\"25\" width=\"412\">\n<p style=\"line-height:100%; margin-top:0; margin-bottom:0;\"><font face=\"돋움\" size=\"2\">사악하게 \n                            그려진 낡은 보물지도</font